# The generated API client is deliberately NOT ignored. contract.sh proves the
# client matches the contract by regenerating it and diffing against what is
# committed — and a diff against an ignored directory always succeeds, so
# ignoring it would leave the client half of that gate passing while proving
# nothing. Generated, committed, and never hand-edited.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
